# Documentation and changelog

Every user-facing, content-structure, deploy, or agent-workflow change
needs its docs updated in the same work: the focused guide under `docs/`,
the index in `README.md`, `public/llms.txt` if its summary changed, and a
short `CHANGELOG.md` entry for significant work only.

Use skill `maintain-project-docs` for the doc map and changelog format.

Do not ship while docs are stale relative to pending changes. When the
tree is already clean, do not re-audit docs by hand — `npm run check`
runs `check:docs`.
